Implement user story SPAN-1: Change the greeting from hello world to hello dolly in every affected codeline

## Story Description
The getGreeting() function currently returns the string 'hello world'. It should instead return 'hello dolly'. Update any test that asserts the old value to match the new one. This change is required independently in each codeline named on this story — the codelines do not share code.

## Acceptance Criteria
- getGreeting() returns exactly 'hello dolly'
- The existing test file's assertion on the return value is updated to match the new value and passes under vitest
- tsc --noEmit exits 0


